Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,While I untangle this chord,\Nhere's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what neural networks are really\Ndoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I set down my tools and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,pull out the right volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, tiny connected units pass\Nsignals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,from one layer to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Each connection can carry a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,more or less influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, the network's output may
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,be far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,During training, feedback adjusts\Nthose connections
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those adjustments repeat, making\Nsome pathways
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,matter more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Layer by layer the network gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,better at recognizing patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it new input and those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,learned patterns help shape an\Noutput.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That basic loop powers many modern
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,AI systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They can work with text, images,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,sound and other kinds of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So the magic is learned patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,weighted connections and repeated\Nadjustment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Like and subscribe to keep growing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the question harvest.
